# Files the repair tool must not touch.
#
# Two independent reasons, both about the repository's own gates rather than
# about the repair itself.
#
# 1. Trunk Check lints the files a change touches and reports their EXISTING
#    findings as new ones. A file with a pre-existing mypy error or a dead
#    import fails the gate the moment anything modifies it, even a one-line
#    path fix. Those files need their own cleanup, not a path rewrite bolted
#    onto it.
#
#      scripts/e2e_real_model.py                    mypy name-defined: "mx"
#      gui/admin-extensions/api/research_panel.py   2 mypy failures
#      scripts/phenotype_omlx_ready.py              ruff F401, unused imports
#
# 2. The shell files below are not shfmt-clean at their base revision. Making
#    them shfmt-clean means adding lines that contain the shell loop terminator,
#    and the repository's happy-path guard (governance/happy-path-precommit.sh,
#    rule R1) reads the loop terminator as an unverified success claim and blocks
#    the commit. The two gates are mutually blocking for these files: Trunk
#    demands the reformat, the guard forbids it.
#
#    The honest fix is to the guard's keyword false positive, not to the
#    rewrite. Until that lands, these files are frozen:
#
#      apps/bench-cockpit/scripts/start-dev.sh
#      beads/bead-ctl.sh
#      beads/refresh-agileplus-token.sh
#      crates/argis-extensions/tools/dag-agent/onboard-repo.sh
#      crates/local-ops/guards/shell-guard.sh
#      crates/phinbox/plugins/droid/install.sh
#      crates/phinbox/plugins/kilo_code/install.sh
#      scripts/cron/every_10m.sh
#      scripts/cross_repo_smoke.sh
#      scripts/forge/forge-proc-reap.sh
#      scripts/install_airlock_v2.sh
#      scripts/phenotype-omlx-env.sh
#
#    That is 25 of the 32 shell sites in the own-code slice. They stay broken
#    until the guard is corrected, and the campaign record says so.

scripts/e2e_real_model.py
gui/admin-extensions/api/research_panel.py
scripts/phenotype_omlx_ready.py

apps/bench-cockpit/scripts/start-dev.sh
beads/bead-ctl.sh
beads/refresh-agileplus-token.sh
crates/argis-extensions/tools/dag-agent/onboard-repo.sh
crates/local-ops/guards/shell-guard.sh
crates/phinbox/plugins/droid/install.sh
crates/phinbox/plugins/kilo_code/install.sh
scripts/cron/every_10m.sh
scripts/cross_repo_smoke.sh
scripts/forge/forge-proc-reap.sh
scripts/install_airlock_v2.sh
scripts/phenotype-omlx-env.sh
